  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IOM for Canada&apos;s Resettlement Activities Globally</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM provides assistance to refugees who have been referred to Canada by the United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR), as well as those who are being privately sponsored for resettlement to Canada. In particular, the IOM will develop capacity and offer assistance in a number of locations globally on befalf of Immigration, Refugees, and Citizenship Canada&apos;s (IRCC).</narrative>
  </description>
